{"id": 27, "ts": 1780456803.320235, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I agree with James that Candidate\u202fC\u2019s 100\u202f% reliability and ability to make correct decisions quickly are critical assets for long\u2011distance operations. Those strengths directly address operational reliability, decision quality, and technical competence. However, I\u2019m less convinced that those advantages outweigh the concerns we\u2019ve noted about his difficulty communicating ideas and his egocentric attitude, which could undermine crew cooperation and professional communication\u2014both essential for safety\u2011critical flights. Compared with Candidate\u202fB, who handles stress very well and is highly conscientious, Candidate\u202fC\u2019s communication weakness may be more detrimental than B\u2019s occasional uncooperativeness. I therefore keep my provisional vote for Candidate\u202fC but recommend we explore how serious the communication issue is before finalising the decision."}
