h targeted training or a probationary period\u2014to ensure they do not impair cockpit coordination on international flights.\nIn short, Candidate\u202fC\u2019s exceptional reliability and decision\u2011making, together with his ability to foster a positive crew environment, were the decisive factors for my support, while his communication difficulty and egocentric demeanor are noted concerns that would have to be mitigated before final selection."}
