{"id": 55, "ts": 1780456985.7164214, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 4, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I agree with Emily that Candidate\u202fB\u2019s strong conscientiousness, excellent stress handling, and solid weather\u2011assessment and computer skills make him a reliable and technically competent long\u2011distance pilot. Those traits directly support operational reliability, stress resilience, and technical competence\u2014key for international routes. However, his weak memory for numbers and the tendency to make nasty remarks about colleagues raise legitimate concerns about attention to detail and crew cooperation, which are essential for safety\u2011critical environments. Compared with Candidate\u202fC, who keeps calm in a crisis and makes quick correct decisions, B still offers a more consistent reliability profile and better stress resilience, while his communication issues can be mitigated through targeted training and monitoring. Therefore, I maintain my provisional recommendation for Candidate\u202fB, pending a plan to address his professional communication concerns."}
